    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own character and immerse yourself in the world of Avataris!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between the 4 races (Gront, Eollyan, Squan and Human) and 9 classes and experience your first steps as Aeya's Champion in Eternity Online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495970/extras/7fd1839d687ce2d163a998dafb2642a4.poster.avif?t=1741620705\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495970/extras/7fd1839d687ce2d163a998dafb2642a4.apng?t=1741620705\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete quests for the residents of Tumbeln, discover Easter-eggs and learn background-info about the story and races of Avataris in a setting inspired by tabletops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Based on the book series &quot;Eternity Online&quot; by Mikkel Robrahn, published by Fischer TOR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can be played with Steamdeck!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
